      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it definitely has the right mood. I just ran it through the tool and the richness score is actually pretty low—it's looking like we're hitting maybe 10-12 unique adjectives. For a luxury launch, we really need that score to be higher to show prestige. \n\nCan you do another pass? Try to expand the imagery and get that adjective count up, but again, please keep it sophisticated. Make sure it still feels like a single, cohesive story rather than just a bunch of descriptors thrown together.",
